### dev-master leg — run this with `stancl/tenancy:dev-master` installed.
#
# Mirror of `phpstan.neon.dist`: same `phpstan-common.neon`, the *opposite*
# stub, and its own baseline. It deliberately does NOT include
# `phpstan-baseline.neon` — that baseline was generated against v3's real
# class shapes, so on this leg most of its patterns match nothing (reported
# as non-ignorable `ignore.unmatched`) while a few could match and silently
# hide a genuine dev-master regression.
#
# Usage:
#   php -d memory_limit=2G vendor/bin/phpstan analyse -c phpstan-dev-master.neon.dist
# (add a writable `tmpDir` override locally — see .claude/rules/static-analysis.md)
includes:
    - phpstan-common.neon
    - phpstan-baseline-dev-master.neon

parameters:
    scanFiles:
        - .phpstan/stancl-tenancy-v3.stub.php
